{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "definitions": {
    "CharacterDef": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/TextKey"
        },
        "facts": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
          },
          "description": "Fets que aquest personatge pot recordar. Serveix per validar el contingut."
        },
        "relation": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "initial": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "min": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "max": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        "description": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/TextKey",
          "description": "Descripció per a \"mirar\" (opcional)."
        },
        "interactions": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/InteractionDef"
          },
          "description": "Interaccions amb aquest personatge a qualsevol sala (una sala les pot substituir)."
        },
        "appearance": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "if": {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/Condition"
              },
              "anim": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "anim"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "description": "Aspecte segons l'estat: la primera entrada que es compleixi diu quina animació (etiqueta del sprite) ha de fer el personatge. Si no se'n compleix cap, la normal. Ex.: el capatàs deixa anar el segell → `{ \"if\": { \"flag\": \"segell_caigut\" }, \"anim\": \"DormSenseSegell\" }`."
        },
        "outfit": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "if": {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/Condition"
              },
              "name": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "name"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "description": "Vestuari segons l'estat: la primera entrada que es compleixi diu quina roba porta (el prefix de les etiquetes del sprite: `Bar` → `BarIdleD`, `BarWalkL`...). Si no se'n compleix cap, la normal. A diferència d'`appearance`, no és una animació fixa: el personatge camina i parla igual."
        },
        "place": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "if": {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/Condition"
              },
              "room": {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
              },
              "x": {
                "type": "number"
              },
              "y": {
                "type": "number"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "room",
              "x",
              "y"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "description": "On és dins una sala segons l'estat: la primera entrada d'aquella sala que es compleixi diu on ha de ser (peus, en píxels de la sala). Si l'estat canvia mentre s'hi és, hi camina; en entrar-hi, ja hi és. Ex.: el vigilant deixa la porta per buscar el nen → `{ \"if\": { \"flag\": \"soler_distret\" }, \"room\": \"aeroport_terminal\", \"x\": 430, \"y\": 190 }`, i una última entrada sense `if` amb el seu lloc de sempre."
        },
        "patrol": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/PatrolDef"
          },
          "description": "Ronda dins una sala segons l'estat: mentre es compleixi, el personatge va i ve pels punts de `path`, per ordre i tornant a començar, i s'atura `pause` segons a cada punt (per defecte, 1,5). Mentre passa alguna cosa (una línia, una conversa, una cinemàtica), s'atura on és, i després continua. Ex.: en Bastida fa la ronda a popa → `{ \"if\": { \"var\": \"escena\", \"op\": \"==\", \"value\": 6 }, \"room\": \"coberta_popa\", \"path\": [{ \"x\": 150, \"y\": 228 }, { \"x\": 470, \"y\": 228, \"face\": \"U\" }] }`."
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "name"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "TextKey": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Clau d'un text a `game/locales/<idioma>/*.json`, p. ex. `\"dlg.pescador.hola\"`."
    },
    "Id": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "InteractionDef": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/Id",
          "description": "Necessari si `once`: identifica la interacció a les partides desades."
        },
        "verb": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            },
            {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
              }
            }
          ],
          "description": "Verb o verbs del motor (`look`, `use`, `pickUp`...), o `*` per a qualsevol."
        },
        "item": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/Id",
          "description": "Amb un objecte de l'inventari (\"fer servir X amb...\"). `*` = qualsevol objecte."
        },
        "if": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/Condition"
        },
        "once": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "Només passa una vegada."
        },
        "lines": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/DialogueLineDef"
          }
        },
        "effects": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/Effect"
          }
        },
        "action": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "name": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "args": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/Scalar"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "name"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "description": "Acció de la lògica del joc (codi), p. ex. la finestra de fase. `\"$item\"` als args = l'objecte fet servir."
        },
        "dialogue": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/Id",
          "description": "Comença aquest diàleg després de les línies."
        },
        "goTo": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/Id",
          "description": "Va a aquesta sala al final."
        },
        "walkIn": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "left",
            "right"
          ],
          "description": "Només a l'`onEnter`: la protagonista entra caminant des de fora de la pantalla, per aquest costat, fins al seu lloc de la sala, i després diu les línies."
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "verb"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Què passa quan el jugador fa un verb sobre alguna cosa. S'agafa la primera interacció de la llista que encaixi (verb, objecte, condició, `once`)."
    },
    "Condition": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "flag": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            },
            "is": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "flag"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "var": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            },
            "op": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/CompareOp"
            },
            "value": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Scalar"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "var",
            "op",
            "value"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "hasItem": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            },
            "who": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            },
            "is": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "hasItem"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "protagonist": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "protagonist"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "remembers": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "who": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                },
                "fact": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                },
                "atLeast": {
                  "type": "number"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "who",
                "fact"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            },
            "is": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "remembers"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "relation": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "who": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                },
                "op": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/CompareOp"
                },
                "value": {
                  "type": "number"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "who",
                "op",
                "value"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "relation"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "quest": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            },
            "status": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/QuestStatus"
                },
                {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/definitions/QuestStatus"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "quest",
            "status"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "objective": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "quest": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                },
                "objective": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "quest",
                "objective"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            },
            "is": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "objective"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "visited": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            },
            "is": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "visited"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "inRoom": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                },
                {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            "who": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "inRoom"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "seen": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "dialogue": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                },
                "node": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "dialogue",
                "node"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            },
            "is": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "seen"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "chosen": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "dialogue": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                },
                "node": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                },
                "choice": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "dialogue",
                "node",
                "choice"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            },
            "is": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "chosen"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "all": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/Condition"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "all"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "any": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/Condition"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "any"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "not": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Condition"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "not"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        }
      ]
    },
    "CompareOp": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "==",
        "!=",
        ">",
        ">=",
        "<",
        "<="
      ]
    },
    "Scalar": {
      "type": [
        "number",
        "string",
        "boolean"
      ]
    },
    "QuestStatus": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "inactive",
        "active",
        "completed",
        "failed"
      ]
    },
    "DialogueLineDef": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "who": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/SpeakerId"
        },
        "text": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/TextKey"
        },
        "if": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/Condition"
        },
        "effects": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/Effect"
          }
        },
        "sound": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/SoundId",
          "description": "So que fa en dir la línia: un fitxer de `game/audio/sfx/` sense extensió. Pot dur variables entre claus, que es posen en acabar la interacció: `\"molla_{molla_tensio}\"` → `molla_3`."
        },
        "stage": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/StageCue"
          },
          "description": "Moviment abans de dir la línia (qui camina, s'asseu, apareix o marxa), per ordre. Només és visual: l'estat no en sap res, i en acabar les línies el motor torna a posar cada personatge com diu l'estat. A l'`onEnter`, el de la primera línia (menys el que camina) ja es fa abans que es vegi la sala."
        },
        "stageAfter": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/StageCue"
          },
          "description": "Moviment en acabar de dir la línia (p. ex. qui diu «me'n vaig» i després marxa), com `stage`."
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "who",
        "text"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "SpeakerId": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
        },
        {
          "type": "string",
          "const": "player"
        },
        {
          "type": "string",
          "const": "narrator"
        },
        {
          "type": "string",
          "const": "title"
        }
      ],
      "description": "`player` = el protagonista, `narrator` = text de narració, `title` = pantalla de títol (p. ex. el canvi d'acte): la pantalla es fon a negre, s'hi mostra el text i torna la imatge."
    },
    "Effect": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "setFlag": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            },
            "value": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "setFlag"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "setVar": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            },
            "value": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Scalar"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "setVar",
            "value"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "addVar": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            },
            "amount": {
              "type": "number"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "addVar",
            "amount"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "giveItem": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            },
            "who": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "giveItem"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "takeItem": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            },
            "who": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "takeItem"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "remember": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "who": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                },
                "fact": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "who",
                "fact"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "remember"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "forget": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "who": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                },
                "fact": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "who",
                "fact"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "forget"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "relation": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "who": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                },
                "change": {
                  "type": "number"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "who",
                "change"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "relation"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "startQuest": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "startQuest"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "completeObjective": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "quest": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                },
                "objective": {
                  "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "quest",
                "objective"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "completeObjective"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "completeQuest": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "completeQuest"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "failQuest": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "failQuest"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "ending": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "ending"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        },
        {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "event": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "args": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": {
                "$ref": "#/definitions/Scalar"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "event"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        }
      ]
    },
    "SoundId": {
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Nom d'un so de `game/audio/sfx/` (sense extensió), amb `{variable}` opcionals."
    },
    "StageCue": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "who": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            },
            {
              "type": "string",
              "const": "player"
            }
          ]
        },
        "prop": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/Id",
          "description": "Una capa del decorat (un prop del motor), en lloc d'un personatge."
        },
        "hold": {
          "type": "number",
          "description": "Després de la indicació, s'espera aquests segons sense text (p. ex. mentre dura l'animació d'un prop). En saltar la cinemàtica, no s'espera."
        },
        "at": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            },
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/StagePoint"
            }
          ],
          "description": "S'hi posa de cop."
        },
        "walk": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Id"
            },
            {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/StagePoint"
            }
          ],
          "description": "Hi camina."
        },
        "wait": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "Amb `walk`: `false` = no s'espera que hi arribi (camina mentre es diu la línia). Per defecte, s'espera."
        },
        "face": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "L",
            "R",
            "U",
            "D"
          ]
        },
        "anim": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "Animació del sprite (p. ex. `Seu`); `null` la treu (torna a estar dret)."
        },
        "visible": {
          "type": "boolean"
        }
      },
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "Una indicació d'escena: `who` (un personatge, o `player` per a la protagonista que juga) i què fa, en aquest ordre: es posa a `at`, es mostra o s'amaga (`visible`), canvia d'animació (`anim`), es gira (`face`) i camina fins a `walk`. Els llocs són una cosa o un personatge de la sala (hi va al seu punt d'arribada) o un punt.\n\nEn lloc de `who`, `prop`: una capa del decorat de la sala que no és al JSON del joc (l'art del motor, p. ex. la zòdiac del pròleg de Ni un ou), que només es mostra o s'amaga (`visible`) i canvia d'animació (`anim`)."
    },
    "StagePoint": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "x": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "y": {
          "type": "number"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "x",
        "y"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "PatrolDef": {
